      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Sebeka%2C_Minnesota",
      "category": "economy",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "During the Great Depression, a New Deal program commissioned an 8.5‑by‑72‑foot fresco in Sebeka, depicting Native life and logging scenes.",
